<title>JAPAN: Nisshin Steel 97/98 capex to rise 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Nisshin Steel 97/98 capex to rise 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nisshin Steel Co Ltd said on Tuesday it plans parent company capital investment of 25 billion yen in the year to March 31, 1998.</p>
<p>The spending would be up 19 percent from an estimated 21 billion yen in 1996/97, it said.</p>
</text>
